#: ../../10-runbook.md:93 86c3faf9a4024384bacbe194fa84e761
msgid "Lua and Cosocket Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Lua 与 Cosocket 排障"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:95 92f85f4e731c49c4b31c61aab9a6b86a
msgid ""
"**A Lua error with `bad argument`/`attempt to call` typically points to a "
"misspelled global or a misused API** - run `luacheck` on the .lua files and "
"confirm `local foo = require(\"foo\")` is used."
msgstr ""
"**出现 `bad argument`/`attempt to call` 这类 Lua 错误，通常指向拼写错误的全局变量或误用的 API**——对 "
".lua 文件运行 `luacheck`，并确认使用 `local foo = require(\"foo\")`。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:98 1d20d830fe9842cea378fa7e7b0bbf1e
msgid ""
"**`attempt to yield across C-call boundary`** - a yielding API "
"(`ngx.location.capture`, `ngx.exit`, a cosocket call) was invoked at module "
"top level or in a phase that cannot yield. Move it into a handler function "
"and respect the [phase rules](08-lua-nginx-module.md)."
msgstr ""
"**`attempt to yield across C-call boundary`**——在模块顶层或不允许让出的阶段调用了会让出的 "
"API（`ngx.location.capture`、`ngx.exit`、cosocket "
"调用）。把它移进处理器函数，并遵守[阶段规则](08-lua-nginx-module.md)。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:102 0d1fb0c9bdff4c4e9675ce499b8971ce
msgid ""
"**`socket busy reading` / `socket busy writing`** - two light threads are "
"using the same cosocket in the same direction at once."
msgstr ""
"**`socket busy reading` / `socket busy writing`**——两个 light thread "
"同时以同一方向使用同一个 cosocket。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:104 2711c9999342488891e5eaf052bd9d19
msgid ""
"**`no resolver defined` on cosocket connect** - see the DNS section below."
msgstr "**cosocket 连接报 `no resolver defined`**——见下面 DNS 一节。"

#: ../../10-runbook.md:105 127b33a4b4eb4846b02d6e0c92a652d2
msgid ""
"**A blocking call stalls all requests on a worker** - `os.execute`, `io.*`, "
"or plain LuaSocket inside a request blocks the event loop; replace with "
"cosocket-based APIs or `ngx.timer`."
msgstr ""
"**阻塞调用会让 worker 上所有请求卡住**——请求内的 `os.execute`、`io.*` 或原生 LuaSocket "
"会阻塞事件循环；请改用基于 cosocket 的 API 或 `ngx.timer`。"

